{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メンバーに、「うちのさくちゃんがね〜」って話すと\n「え？誰？わんちゃん？犬飼ってるの？」\nって聞かれる事が多くて、\nみんな知らないんだ！！！って\nびっくりしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから皆さんも知らないかも...？？\nと思って、改めて紹介しますー\\( ˆoˆ )/\n多分すっごい昔に紹介しただけだったもんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤家の三女、ミニチュアダックスフンドの\n「さくら」です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いでしょ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\n素敵でしょ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\n賢い顔してるでしょ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\n犬バカだよ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日さくちゃんの横にバフッと寝転がったら\nさくちゃんは抵抗せず一緒に寝てくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい〜♡可愛い〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと仲良く暮らせたらいいなって思います\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当さくちゃんいると元気になれるもん！\nペットというか家族というか...\n大切な存在です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院行ってきました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルージュに染めて、カットもしたんだけど\n前髪も切ってもらっちゃいました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに前髪がこれくらい短くて動揺。\n少し幼くなったかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(そういえば！新しいチョーカーだよ♡)\n(「DAMMY」っていうブランド♡)\n(ちなみに赤のニットキャミソールは、Honey Cinnamonだよ♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切る前はこんな感じで、とっても長かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクが薄いからかな？\n男装してるみたい...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...男装？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装...男装...だん...だ...しつ...執事...執事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(上手く繋げられず。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの生写真のときの。\n温存していました。ずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの前髪で\n嬉しくもあり恥ずかしくもあり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これくらいの長さだと横に流すこともできるし\n巻けば目の上にもなるし、\n色々なアレンジしたいな！と思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アレンジしたら載せるね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？のときのオフショット。\n私のお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣にいるのはみなみと、ずーだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいな〜\n楽しかったな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこの時に戻りたいな。\nいや、この時以上になりたいな。\n何事も我慢と辛抱と続けることが大事だよね。\n頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだコーナー募集中♪\n何それ〜って方は前々回のブログ参照だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Chiharu ♫ Now Playing"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大好き」大原櫻子さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケで歌えるようになりたいから\n聴きながら歌を練習中♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}